Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: runsuite.c
Line: 864
Function: rngTestStreaming
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: After xmlRelaxNGParse, the code incorrectly checks rng_parser_ctx (lines 820-823) instead of schema, and after creating validation_ctx, it again checks rng_parser_ctx (lines 828-832) instead of validation_ctx. If schema parsing or context creation fails, validation_ctx can be NULL, yet xmlRelaxNGValidatePushElement is called at line 864 with this NULL context, causing a NULL pointer dereference.

Source context:
